Value NEIGHBOR (\S+)
Value VERSION (\d+)
Value AS (\d+)
Value MSG_RCVD (\d+)
Value MSG_SENT (\d+)
Value TBL_VER (\d+)
Value IN_Q (\d+)
Value OUT_Q (\d+)
Value UP_DOWN (\S+)
Value STATE_PFXRCD (\S+)

Start
  # FRR `show ip bgp summary` neighbor rows. State/PfxRcd is a prefix count
  # when Established, else a state word (Active/Idle/Connect) or "(Policy)".
  ^${NEIGHBOR}\s+${VERSION}\s+${AS}\s+${MSG_RCVD}\s+${MSG_SENT}\s+${TBL_VER}\s+${IN_Q}\s+${OUT_Q}\s+${UP_DOWN}\s+${STATE_PFXRCD} -> Record
  ^Neighbor\s+V\s+AS
  ^BGP\s+router\s+identifier
  ^BGP\s+table\s+version
  ^RIB\s+entries
  ^Peers\s+
  ^IPv\d\s+Unicast\s+Summary
  ^Total\s+number\s+of\s+neighbors
  ^\s*$$
  ^\.\s*$$
